.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt GROUPADD 8
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm groupadd
.Nd add a group
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl ov
.Op Fl g Ar gid
.Ar group
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility adds
.Ar group
to
.Pa /etc/group ,
in the shape of the
.Nx
and
.Ox
command.
It is
.Xr pw 8
under another name.
It must be run by the superuser.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width "-g gid"
.It Fl g Ar gid
The group ID; by default the lowest free one in the range of
.Xr usermgmt.conf 5 .
.It Fl o
Allow a group ID already in use.
.It Fl v
Say what was done.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
As
.Xr pw 8 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr group 5 ,
.Xr groupdel 8 ,
.Xr groupmod 8 ,
.Xr pw 8
.Sh HISTORY
A
.Nm
utility appeared in
.Nx 1.5
and
.Ox 2.7 .
This implementation was written for OxideBSD.
